<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:08:43 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:08:43 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>変更履歴</title> <category>changelog</category> <category>meta</category> <description>変更履歴 — このページは merged PR のメタデータから meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py で機械生成されています。手で編集しないでください。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png" type="image/png" length="19713" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 概念（テストの目的とトポロジ）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの概念・目的・トポロジ・対応 testbed を整理する。SONiC が「SRC_IP = DST_IP」のパケットを正しく L3 ルーティングできるかを sonic-mgmt の PTF / pytest で検証するテストインフラ HLD。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="31944" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 内部実装（パケット仕様 / パラメータ）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの dip_sip.py パラメータと送受信パケット仕様（DIP=SIP のまま L3 ルーティング、TTL/HL が 1 減って受信される）を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-internals/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-internals.png" type="image/png" length="26248" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 制限事項と HLD-実装乖離（pytest 移行）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの制限事項・干渉する機能・トラブルシューティング、および ansible/ptftests から sonic-mgmt/tests/ipfwd/test_dip_sip.py (pytest) への移行に伴う HLD-実装乖離を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-limitations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-limitations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-limitations.png" type="image/png" length="39543" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証 運用（ファイル構成 / 前処理 / 実行）</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テストの sonic-mgmt 配下ファイル構成と Ansible 前処理ワークフロー、実行コマンドを整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-operations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design-operations.png" type="image/png" length="26687" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テスト</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テスト — 「DIP（destination IP）と SIP（source IP）が同じ」L3 パケットを SONiC スイッチが正しくルーティングできるかを PTF (Packet Test Framework) で検証 するテストの設計。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design.png" type="image/png" length="30488" /> </item> <item> <title>sFlow（hsflowd / sflowmgrd / SAI sample-packet）</title> <description>sFlow（hsflowd / sflowmgrd / SAI sample-packet） — sFlow は ASIC が一定 sampling-rate でパケットをサンプリングし、収集サーバ（collector）に UDP でフォワードする統計プロトコル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sflow-high-level-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sflow-high-level-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sflow-high-level-design.png" type="image/png" length="59168" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック 概念（SsdBase / SsdUtil 二段プラグイン）</title> <description>SONiC の SSD ヘルスチェック機能（show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil プラグイン）の概念と二段プラグインアーキテクチャ（SsdBase / SsdUtil）を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="43432" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック 内部実装（API 仕様 / ssdmond）</title> <description>SONiC の SSD ヘルスチェック機能の API 仕様（SsdBase / SsdUtil の public method）と Optional 常時監視デーモン ssdmond の設計を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-internals.png" type="image/png" length="40377" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック 制限事項と HLD-実装乖離</title> <description>SONiC の SSD ヘルスチェック機能の制限事項・干渉する機能・トラブルシューティング、および現行 master と HLD 記述の乖離（ssdutil への移行、sonic_storage 再構成、ssdmond 未取り込み）を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-limitations.png" type="image/png" length="30008" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック 運用（CLI / 表示モード）</title> <description>SONiC の SSD ヘルスチェック機能の CLI（show platform ssdhealth）の使い方と 3 表示モード（brief / verbose / vendor）、設定の有無を整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design-operations.png" type="image/png" length="32564" /> </item> <item> <title>SSD ヘルスチェック（show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil プラグイン）</title> <description>SSD ヘルスチェック（show platform ssdhealth + ssdutil プラグイン） — SONiC が動く NOS は組み込み SSD / mSATA に書き込みを行うため、ストレージの寿命と健全性を運用者が把握できる 必要がある。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/ssdhealth-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/ssdhealth-design.png" type="image/png" length="49361" /> </item> <item> <title>gNMI Master Arbitration（election ID と SetRequest 拡張）</title> <description>gNMI Master Arbitration（election ID と SetRequest 拡張） — gNMI Master Arbitration は 複数の SDN コントローラ（gNMI クライアント）が 1 台の SONiC スイッチに同時接続し得る環境で、Set RPC を出せるのは唯一のマスタだけ…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnmi-master-arbitration-hld/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnmi-master-arbitration-hld/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/gnmi-master-arbitration-hld.png" type="image/png" length="58731" /> </item> <item> <title>gNSI（Certz / Authz / Pathz / Credentialz）の Rotate モデル</title> <description>gNSI（Certz / Authz / Pathz / Credentialz）の Rotate モデル — gNSI（gRPC Network Security Interface）は、ネットワーク機器の セキュリティクレデンシャルを gRPC 経由で安全にローテーションする ためのマイクロサービス群である。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnsi-hld/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/gnsi-hld/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/gnsi-hld.png" type="image/png" length="54594" /> </item> <item> <title>P4RT アプリケーション（PINS の gRPC サービス、port 9559）</title> <description>P4RT アプリケーション（PINS の gRPC サービス、port 9559） — P4RT アプリケーションは PINS（P4 Integrated Network Stack）プロジェクトが SONiC に追加するコンポーネントで、P4Runtime v1.3.0 を実装する gRPC サービスとして TCP…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/p4rt-application-hld/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/p4rt-application-hld/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/p4rt-application-hld.png" type="image/png" length="50555" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC YANG モデル記述ガイドライン（ABNF.json → sonic-*.yang）</title> <description>SONiC YANG モデル記述ガイドライン（ABNF.json → sonic-*.yang） — SONiC の YANG モデルは ABNF.json で表現された Redis スキーマを RFC 7950 準拠の YANG に写像したもの。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-yang-model-guidelines/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-yang-model-guidelines/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/sonic-yang-model-guidelines.png" type="image/png" length="61438" /> </item> <item> <title>トンネルトラフィックの DSCP / TC リマップ（Dual-ToR PFC デッドロック回避）</title> <description>トンネルトラフィックの DSCP / TC リマップ（Dual-ToR PFC デッドロック回避） — Dual-ToR（Active / Standby）でサーバ側輻輳が起きると upper / lower 両 ToR に PFC pause が同時に伝搬 する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/dscp-remapping-for-tunnel-traffic/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/overlay/dscp-remapping-for-tunnel-traffic/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/overlay/dscp-remapping-for-tunnel-traffic.png" type="image/png" length="47661" /> </item> <item> <title>SAI 失敗時の dump 取得（syncd_dump.sh / SAI_REDIS_NOTIFY_SYNCD_INVOKE_DUMP）</title> <description>SAI 失敗時の dump 取得（syncd_dump.sh / SAI_REDIS_NOTIFY_SYNCD_INVOKE_DUMP） — SAI 呼び出しが失敗すると orchagent は abort し、syncd を含む各 service が再起動される。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/dump-on-sai-failure/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/dump-on-sai-failure/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/dump-on-sai-failure.png" type="image/png" length="56548" /> </item> <item> <title>FEC FLR 概念（FLR / CER / interleaving / observed vs predicted）</title> <description>FEC FLR (Frame Loss Ratio) 機能の概念整理。Codeword Error Ratio との関係、interleaving factor の役割、observed FLR と predicted FLR の使い分け、FEC counter から FLR を導出する基本式をまとめる。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/fec-flr-support-in-sonic-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/fec-flr-support-in-sonic-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/fec-flr-support-in-sonic-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="50577" /> </item> <item> <title>FEC FLR 内部実装（port_flr.lua / FlexCounterOrch / SAI counter mapping）</title> <description>FEC FLR 機能の内部実装。port_flr.lua counter-poll プラグインの登録位置、参照する SAI counter、observed/predicted の計算手順、FlexCounterOrch が CONFIG_DB から FLEX_COUNTER_DB へ FLR_INTERVAL_FACTOR を伝搬する経路を解説する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/fec-flr-support-in-sonic-internals/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 18:06:37 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/fec-flr-support-in-sonic-internals/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/fec-flr-support-in-sonic-internals.png" type="image/png" length="49657" /> </item> </channel> </rss>